  "time_policy": "Original publication dates and simulated discovery clocks are preserved; UTC reporting weeks; date-only publication encodes 00:00 UTC, not an asserted event time.",
  "annotation_policy": {
    "definition": "Event is a business occurrence with a clear actor and scope that can be followed as one matter. Development is progress within it; Article/Mention supplies evidence.",
