    "state": "Active acquisition/regulatory proceedings are ongoing; announced future facilities remain announced until implementation is evidenced. Clearance or provisional/initial decisions alone do not establish transaction completion. Actual abandonment or explicit facility closure is resolved. Label uncertainties are recorded separately, never silently accepted as correct.",
    "development": "Later procedural rulings and revised provisional opinions are new_development, not correction/conflict. Independent official endorsement of already reported terms is corroboration.",
    "review": "Assistant read cited passages and assigned labels before seeing predictions; no second annotator or human adjudication.",
    "date_policy": "Date-only published_at is normalized midnight UTC. discovered_at is a simulated chronological replay time, not real discovery history. No future articles, annotations, scope labels, or event catalog are supplied to E.",
